  "prefLabel": "Ncr 212.03 Order of Proceeding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 212.03 Order of Proceeding.\n\n(a) Any person offering testimony, evidence, or argument shall state for the record their name, and role in the proceeding. If the person is representing another person, the person being represented shall also be identified.\n\n(b) Testimony shall be offered in the following order:\n\n(1) The party or parties bearing the burden of proof and such witnesses as the party may call; and\n\n(2) The party or parties opposing the party who bears the overall burden of proof and such witnesses as the party may call.\n\nSource. #14254, INTERIM, eff 5-23-25; ss by #14447, eff 12-4-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr200.html"
